\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {8.10}{\ignorespaces Match-side crash and timeout thresholds. Each cell gives the largest swept $n$ that completed (\text  {$\mathsurround \z@ \mathchar "458$}) above the first $n$ that failed ($\times $); a dash means every swept $n$ completed. The standard variants fail by crashing and the \texttt  {deriv\_bc} and partial-derivative columns by timing out, so the $\times $ entries denote a crash in the first column and a timeout in the other two.}}{76}{table.caption.57}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:patho-crash-thresholds}{{8.10}{76}{Match-side crash and timeout thresholds. Each cell gives the largest swept $n$ that completed (\checkmark ) above the first $n$ that failed ($\times $); a dash means every swept $n$ completed. The standard variants fail by crashing and the \texttt {deriv\_bc} and partial-derivative columns by timing out, so the $\times $ entries denote a crash in the first column and a timeout in the other two}{table.caption.57}{}}
